Z||000000||1FST2M6||04-02-2001||10:16 AM||||a friend of mine was at the track on saturday. in a drag rail and just past the 60' line his right rear tire shreaded and sent the HUGE Mickey Thompson sailing. and putting the car into the guard rail landing him in the hospital. he'll be ok but will be in the Hospital for the next couple days for observation... (Very broken right arm, concusion, and bumps and bruises)  Pics of the thrashed car and guardrail to come in the next few days. <P>NHRA approved cage and all the saftey equipment surely saved him but still rattled his cage pretty well...  ||||reg||9
